  ],
  "conclusion": "$\\mathcal{Z}_{\\beta}({\\rm Haar}_{n})=e^{-\\beta}\\left[\\cosh\\beta+(d_{n}^{2}-1)\\Gamma\\!\\left(\\tfrac{d_{n}+1}{2}\\right)\\left(\\tfrac{2}{\\beta}\\right)^{\\frac{d_{n}-1}{2}}I_{\\frac{d_{n}-1}{2}}(\\beta)\\right]$.",
